# ── Dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This project has no build step (React/Recharts/Babel come from a CDN), but
# parsecheck.cjs needs @babel/standalone installed somewhere.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-store/

# ── Secrets and credentials ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTE: this project's real secrets are NOT in .env files — SYNC_TOKEN,
# FINNHUB_KEY and PROXY_URL are hardcoded in index.html and worker.js, which
# .gitignore cannot help with. See docs/decisions.md and the repo README.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets.json
credentials.json
.dev.vars
.wrangler/

# ── App data exports and backups ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Settings → Download writes allocation-backup-YYYY-MM-DD.json, which is a
# COMPLETE dump of the user's finances: salaries, bank balances, holdings,
# net worth, every logged transaction. Never commit one.
allocation-backup-*.json
*-backup-*.json
backup/
backups/
exports/
*.bak

# ── Local databases ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# ── Editor / OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# ── Local tool state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Machine-specific Claude Code permissions; the shared skills under
# .claude/skills/ are intentionally NOT ignored.
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── Scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
sandbox/
tmp/
*.log
